{
  "name": "Harp Bow Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>This skill only produces an effect when you are equipped with a [Bow]. You may reduce the [Hate] cost of &laquo;Maestro Echo&raquo; and &laquo;Exceptional Blow&raquo; to 0.</p>\n<p>(SR2): Increase the range of [Bows] you are equipped with by +1.<br>(SR3): You can use &laquo;Repeat Note&raquo; with [Range: 4 Sq.]</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A fighting style in which the bow is handled with the elegance of plucking a lyre. The pure sound of strings echoes with each arrow that is fired, inspiring allies.</p>",
